// Settings shared by every configuration. The endpoints live in
// Debug.xcconfig and Release.xcconfig, which include this file; set the app
// target's Debug and Release configurations to those two, not to this one.

// Checkout pins a new delivery address at the device's current fix.
INFOPLIST_KEY_NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription = Pins your delivery address at the door so the kitchen's driver can find you.
